%% A frame that names itself as a source draws its own loop (https://github.com/mermaid-js/mermaid-v13/issues/672).
eventmodeling
tf 01 cmd Start
tf 02 evt Started ->> 01
tf 03 evt Continued ->> 02
tf 04 evt Finished ->> 03 ->> 02
tf 05 rmo Status ->> 04 ->> 02
tf 06 ui Screen ->> 05 ->> 06
tf 07 cmd Retry ->> 06
rf 08 evt Retried ->> 07
tf 09 rmo Again
